   "id": "8b23f663-35e6-4615-a5ce-b63e82e5b6a2",
   "memory": "Assistant stated that enabling NPU execution on 910B requires adding a few lines (import torch_npu and an NPU branch) to the code.\n\n**attributed_to**: \"assistant\"",
