  {
   "id": "5367dd08-53fd-44f6-89ff-aa3e6903916c",
   "memory": "Assistant provided a private training guide for CLM, stating that private training is lightweight: only the two ~20M-parameter projection heads need to be trained while the Qwen3-8B encoder remains frozen, and the entire pipeline (data preparation, embedding computation, head training, serving) runs locally with no data leaving the system, with no public pre‑training pipeline available.\n\nThe private‑training path is therefore head fine‑tuning (warm‑start official heads).",
   "user_id": "o9cq80w9VpKJq9SaClYSc_EwYF1E@im.wechat",
   "metadata": {
